      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining OAuth Provider**\n\nI'm focusing on crafting a `start_oauth_login.py` script for OAuth authorization. Google's the chosen provider. I am creating the structure for this Python file to handle the OAuth/OIDC flow, and ensure Google's identifier is in place.\n\n\n**Constructing Google OAuth**\n\nI've decided to start with Google for the OAuth provider implementation. My script, `start_oauth_login.py`, now defines essential Google OAuth endpoints and parameters. I'm focusing on crafting the authorization URL with the correct parameters, specifically client ID, redirect URI, and scopes. My goal is to generate and print this authorization URL, to kickoff the OAuth login process.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789865354667,
          "start": 1789865352270
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc49dc4e00116NjEPi6Mm2Rkx",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc49d74f001H78DF1Z70PjOui",
      "session_id": "ses_f43b62931ffeIR2q7My5vqfRzU",
      "time_created": 1789865352270,
      "time_updated": 1789865354668
    },
    {
      "data": {
        "callID": "dU9T8aMF2NwQH5Ff",
        "metadata": {
          "google": {
            "thoughtSignature": ""
          }
        },
        "state": {
          "input": {
            "content": "\nimport os\nimport urllib.parse\n\n# Google OAuth 2.0 Configuration\nGOOGLE_CLIENT_ID = os.environ.get(\"GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID\", \"YOUR_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID\")\nGOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI = os.environ.get(\"GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI\", \"http://localhost:8000/callback\")\n\n# Scopes for Google (e.g., profile and email)\nGOOGLE_SCOPES = [\n    \"https://www.googleapis.com/auth/userinfo.profile\",\n    \"https://www.googleapis.com/auth/userinfo.email\"\n]\n\n# Google Authorization Endpoint\nGOOGLE_AUTHORIZATION_BASE_URL = \"https://accounts.google.com/o/oauth2/v2/auth\"\n\ndef start_google_oauth_login():\n    \"\"\"\n    Constructs and prints the Google OAuth authorization URL.\n    \"\"\"\n    params = {\n        \"client_id\": GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID,\n        \"redirect_uri\": GOOGLE_REDIRECT_URI,\n        \"response_type\": \"code\",\n        \"scope\": \" \".join(GOOGLE_SCOPES),\n        \"access_type\": \"offline\",  # To get a refresh token\n        \"prompt\": \"consent\"       # To ensure refresh token is always returned\n    }\n    \n    authorization_url = f\"{GOOGLE_AUTHORIZATION_BASE_URL}?{urllib.parse.urlencode(params)}\"\n    print(f\"Please visit this URL to authorize with Google:\\n{authorization_url}\")\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    start_google_oauth_login()\n",
            "filePath": "start_oauth_login.py"
          },
